📊 5️⃣ MASTERY RULES

Define mastery as:

Accuracy ≥ required_accuracy
Rhythm index ≥ required_rhythm
Technique score ≥ required_technique
Composite ≥ required_composite
AND
Consistency stable (low volatility)

Also require:

Minimum 3 successful sessions above threshold.

This prevents accidental unlock.

🧠 6️⃣ LEVEL PROGRESSION RULE

Beginner → Intermediate when:

Composite score ≥ 0.75

Rhythm index ≥ 0.7

Technique score ≥ 0.6

At least 5 alankars mastered

Intermediate → Advanced when:

Composite ≥ 0.85

Technique score ≥ 0.75

At least 1 song mastered

